flowchart TD
    A[Authenticate user] --> B[Create supplier, unit, category]
    B --> C[Create product with links to master data]
    C --> D[Create purchase lines]
    D --> E[Purchase pending]
    E --> F{Purchase approved?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Increase product quantity]
    F -- No --> E
    G --> H[Create customer or choose existing customer]
    H --> I[Create invoice lines]
    I --> J[Create payment summary]
    J --> K[Invoice pending]
    K --> L{Stock sufficient?}
    L -- No --> K
    L -- Yes --> M[Approve invoice]
    M --> N[Decrease product quantity]
    N --> O{Due amount remains?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Record customer payment]
    O -- No --> Q[Paid invoice]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Stock, invoice, customer, and date reports]
